<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Comfort Care Property Manager Flyer</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #0066cc;
            --primary-dark: #0052a3;
            --accent: #10b981;
            --text: #1f2937;
            --muted: #6b7280;
            --bg: #f5f9ff;
            --card: #ffffff;
            --border: #dbe7f8;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: "Segoe UI", Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            color: var(--text);
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #eef5ff 0%, #ffffff 100%);
            line-height: 1.45;
        }

        .flyer {
            max-width: 980px;
            margin: 28px auto;
            background: var(--card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 16px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
        }

        .hero {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary) 0%, var(--primary-dark) 65%, #0c7ea6 100%);
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 34px 34px 26px;
        }

        .brand {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.06em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            opacity: 0.95;
        }

        h1 {
            margin: 10px 0 10px;
            font-size: 2rem;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }

        .hero p {
            margin: 0;
            max-width: 780px;
            font-size: 1.03rem;
            opacity: 0.98;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 28px 34px 22px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
            gap: 22px;
        }

        .panel {
            background: #f9fcff;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 18px 18px 14px;
        }

        h2 {
            margin: 0 0 10px;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: var(--primary-dark);
        }

        p {
            margin: 0 0 10px;
            color: var(--muted);
        }

        ul {
            margin: 0;
            padding-left: 18px;
        }

        li {
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            color: #334155;
        }

        .equipment-list li {
            margin-bottom: 7px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #1e293b;
        }

        .pill-row {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 8px;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        .pill {
            background: #e8f2ff;
            color: var(--primary-dark);
            border: 1px solid #c7ddfb;
            border-radius: 999px;
            padding: 6px 11px;
            font-size: 0.87rem;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .cta {
            margin: 6px 34px 30px;
            background: #effaf5;
            border: 1px solid #c7efde;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 18px;
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 14px;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }

        .cta strong {
            color: #0f5132;
        }

        .contact {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 4px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #0f5132;
        }

        .footer-note {
            margin: 0 34px 28px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #64748b;
        }

        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .content {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            h1 {
                font-size: 1.65rem;
            }
        }

        @media print {
            body {
                background: #ffffff;
            }

            .flyer {
                margin: 0;
                box-shadow: none;
                border: none;
                border-radius: 0;
                max-width: 100%;
            }

            .hero,
            .content,
            .cta,
            .footer-note {
                break-inside: avoid;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <main class="flyer">
        <section class="hero">
            <div class="brand">Comfort Care | Norcross, GA</div>
            <h1>Rehab-Ready Apartment Units for Property Managers</h1>
            <p>Stand out in your market with safe recovery-ready units for residents after surgery or injury while supporting aging-in-place living.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="content">
            <article class="panel">
                <h2>Why This Service Matters</h2>
                <p>More apartment communities are looking for ways to differentiate. One of the fastest-growing resident needs is short-term recovery support at home.</p>
                <p>Comfort Care partners with management teams to create low-cost, mobility-ready units that help improve occupancy and retention.</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>No capital investment required</li>
                    <li>Turnkey setup and equipment coordination</li>
                    <li>Designed for multifamily and senior-friendly housing</li>
                </ul>
                <div class="pill-row">
                    <span class="pill">Boost Occupancy</span>
                    <span class="pill">Increase Retention</span>
                    <span class="pill">Resident Support</span>
                    <span class="pill">Operationally Simple</span>
                </div>
            </article>

            <article class="panel">
                <h2>We Can Outfit 5 to 10 Units Per Property</h2>
                <ul class="equipment-list">
                    <li>Wheelchair</li>
                    <li>Walker or Rollator</li>
                    <li>Knee Scooter</li>
                    <li>Cane</li>
                    <li>Mobility Devices Matched to Resident Needs</li>
                </ul>
            </article>
        </section>

        <section class="cta">
            <div>
                <strong>If you manage multifamily or senior-friendly housing, let us help you launch rehab-ready units quickly.</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="contact">
                <div>Phone: 678-362-2345</div>
                <div>Web: comcare.store</div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <p class="footer-note">Comfort Care provides mobility equipment rental services for communities across the Atlanta area.</p>
        <p class="footer-note">Comfort Care is a trade name of MOON LIGHTING INC.</p>
    </main>
</body>
</html>